---
/* Component — PageFooterMain
 * The footer's main band. Each direct child — a PageFooterBrand or a
 * PageFooterNav — becomes one column, laid out in a row.
 *
 * grid-auto-flow: column means columns are created as children arrive rather
 * than declared up front, so the band takes however many children it is given
 * without the component knowing the count — which it could not learn anyway,
 * since Astro slots are opaque. The columns follow the inline axis, so the row
 * mirrors under RTL.
 *
 * align-items: start keeps columns top-aligned rather than stretched, so a tall
 * column does not drag the others' content down with it. */
---

<div>
  <slot />
</div>

<style>
  div {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    align-items: start;
    gap: var(--bravoixr-spacing-10);
  }
</style>
